  m_Name: lv1_drag_mitral
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Cardio.Runtime::Cardio.Data.PuzzleData
  PuzzleId: lv1_drag_mitral
  Type: 1
  Complexity: 2
  Prompt: Drag the label onto the structure it names.
  TargetStructureId: mitral_valve
  LabelText: Mitral Valve
  Options: []
  CorrectOptionIndex: 0
  SequenceSteps: []
  Explanation: Correct. The mitral valve guards the inflow from the left atrium.
  Hint: It is the pale two-leaflet structure at the inflow end.
--- !u!114 &-3812152009303774865
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
